{
  "schema": "samedaydesk.x402-protocol-fixtures.w831-route-absent.v1",
  "scope": "An undeclared x402 path is route_absent: not HTTP 402, not PAYMENT-REQUIRED, not facilitator verify/settle. Catalogs that list the origin on a different path report priceObservation.status route_absent. Declared paid GET /extract still 402s; GET /healthz is a present unpaid surface, not route_absent. Loopback merchant only; never pay, never xpay/CDP, never checkout.",
